# ICNM site — locked decisions

Read `docs/DECISIONS.md` and `docs/CONTEXT.md` before changing scope, IA, or stack. Glossary terms in CONTEXT.md are the project language.

- Official replacement of `ichnm.by` after institute sign-off. Domain does not change.
- Look and IA follow iboch.by; not a pixel clone. Keep ICNM sections: developments, facilities, AIST.
- Personal pages at `people/{id}/`. A person can belong to several units; the person page lists all affiliations. Cards are the hyperlink (no extra biography caption). Labs remain packs at `labs/{slug}/` on this site, not separate domains. Each lab pack includes **Действующие и завершённые научные проекты** (current / completed); that list stays on the lab page in v1, not a new top-menu catalogue. Structure dropdown: labs, then admin units, then union and young scientists. Lab **направления / оборудование / разработки** are WP CPTs (`direction`, `facility`, `development`) with admin menus like Персоналии; packs and institute hubs query them; sync does not wipe editor-owned meta (2026-09-23).
- Top menu: Об институте (сведения, руководство, **Структура** with nested labs/admin/union, folder **Научная деятельность**, учёный совет, facilities, документы without requisites, **электронные обращения** as About-level sibling, vacancies); News is one combined page (institute + СМИ); events; **Для студентов** (НИР студентов, трудоустройство выпускников); contacts (feedback + **реквизиты**). The science folder has no page; pointer click → **Направления работы**; also children: developments, cooperation, publications, education. Education children: аспирантура, докторантура, совет по защитам, стажировки (no courses). Documents child **«Для сотрудника»**; no root «Сотрудникам». Dropdown parent *pages* are links; first submenu row repeats the section page (no «страница раздела» caption). A folder parent is a label only (except science click → directions). Lab catalogues feed institute pages; science and facilities cards keep lab and staff attribution. Publications name the lab and DOI only.
- v1 language: **structure** in RU/EN/BE/ZH (`/`, `/en/`, `/be/`, `/zh/`). Institute body copy stays Russian until official translation. Language switcher maps equivalent pages.
- WordPress + Kadence (same constructor as iboch.by). The same staff role publishes news, events, «СМИ о нас», publications, and catalogue CPTs (direction / facility / development). Do not let editors break header, footer, or vitrine pages.
- Plan a PHP tariff at Active.by or Hoster.by. Do not put WordPress on the current Java Forever stack.
- Homepage: short official intro, mixed news + media-about-us, entries to structure/developments, next event. No 3D promo. Achievements live under About. No separate announcements feed; contact form is in the header.
- Documents: charter, anti-corruption, requisites deep-link, **«Для сотрудника»** + staff-norm shelves. Electronic appeals sit under About (sibling of Documents). Requisites sit under Contacts.
- Theme: day|night only; clock sets default; no auto in the user cycle (2026-09-21).
- Leadership: director, deputies, honorary director, учёный секретарь, reception. Cooperation: world map with partner pins. Contacts/footer: Minsk outline in the same theme colours, pin at Skaryna 36.
- Footer: stable NAS pack (president, government, pravo.by, Navuka, profnan.by, NAS portal) + NAS socials + ICNM socials when URLs exist. No empty icons. No seasonal Academy banners.
- AIST is a section on this site; files from aist.ichnm.by live there; registration stays on aist.ichnm.by; not a mini-site or form.
- Cutover: test URL first; old site stays until sign-off. ICNM mark is `ИХНМ-Иконка.ai` → `ichnm-mark.svg` (not `ICHNM_Bew.ai` in the header). NAS emblem may still crop until its vector arrives.
- The builder is the institute developer and configurator (hosting, admin, migration). Colleagues still supply source files; there is no second counterpart.
- Visually-impaired mode in v1 (plugin, IBOCH-class).
- Announcements were dropped (2026-08-31).
- Search (people / units / facilities / developments) and sitemap are header/footer utilities, not extra top-menu roots. Page-open veil animation is NAS-class; off in BVI and reduced-motion.
- Honest `preview/` keeps empty slots except where real institute files exist (AIST PDFs, news photos from ichnm.by). `preview-filled/` is a separate letter-coded dummy (А–Д by lab) with fish images — not official copy; it is the staff demo of finished look/IA and must not warn about missing institute files. Regenerate with `scripts/build_preview.py`.

If a request contradicts `docs/DECISIONS.md`, stop and ask. Product forks from grilling are closed; remaining gaps are files and hosting access.
